This repository consolidates research materials from the Three Gorges Reservoir microseismic catalog study.

The CSNBench snapshot in third_party/csnbench is derived from commit d7d58f0926bbf8df4c9081e484634d6e1ecf689d and retains its upstream GPL-3.0 terms.

REAL, VELEST, hypoDD and ph2dt executables are not distributed here and must be obtained from their respective upstream sources.

The archived inference artifacts under models/regional/ retain their historical `diting.*` filenames: four TorchScript `.jit` checkpoints and four corresponding `.pt` files. Their SHA-256 hashes are documented in models/README.md and SHA256SUMS. These project-specific trained artifacts are distributed with the agreement of the project contributors as part of the manuscript reproducibility package.

Raw continuous waveform archives are intentionally excluded from Git because of their size. The distributed data products and figure inputs are documented in the accompanying data-availability, provenance, and licensing files.
